  {
   "role": "AXStaticText",
   "name": "",
   "value": "Drag depends on the cross-sectional area facing the air and on a drag coefficient that captures how streamlined the body is. A flat, spread-out body presents a large area and falls slowly; a narrow, pointed body falls much faster.",
